    },
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "id": 15,
      "options": {
        "content": "**Hourly read-only collection covers the 10 guests in the Ansible guest inventory.** This table uses the separate **Managed host** filter; journal panels still use **Host**. **Last successful update check** is verified per host, with historical Semaphore task end times used for backfill. It can mean no packages needed upgrading. **Last package upgrade** comes from completed APT history; missing/rotated evidence is **Unknown**. **Last checked** is observation freshness. Reboot status reads the current guest flag; **LXC guests share a Proxmox kernel**, so no guest flag does not establish the host's reboot requirement. No updates, reboots or hardening are triggered by this dashboard. Latest reading per host is retained in a **7-day lookback**, ending at the selected end time.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Maintenance coverage and meaning",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ]
}
